<title>USA: Runnemede, N.J., approves $2.95 mln school bonds.</title>
<headline>Runnemede, N.J., approves $2.95 mln school bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voters in Runnemede, N.J., Wednesday approved a $2.95 million bond issue for school renovations and construction.</p>
<p>The vote was 678-425, a school district official said Thursday.</p>
<p>--Steven Dickson, 212-859-1652</p>
</text>
